  "said": "Money\n\nYou’re square with everyone.\n\nWho pays whom\n\nNobody owes anybody.\n\nWhat people paid for\n\nbo, through cy’s computer, paid $400.00 for the rent, split between bo. Say you were in on it\nWhen someone adds what they paid, it is split between them and whoever says they were in on it. Everyone in your group — ada, bo, cy — sees it.\n\nAdd what you paid\n\nWhat it was for:  How much:  Add it, paid by you\n\n",
