  "said": "Bring things to the table\n\nMoney is on the table.\n\nThese come with svrngs. Bring one, and everyone in house opens it on their own computer or phone, while any computer in house is on.\n\n Events: post a get-together, and see who’s coming.\n\n House rules: the rules your house agrees, and how you agree them.\n\nBring the ticked ones to house\n\nMoney opens at its new version for you now.\n\n"
}
.Money's run: {
  "after": [
    "Money\n\nYou’re square with everyone.\n\nWho pays whom\n\nNobody owes anybody.\n\nWhat people paid for\n\nYou paid $42.00 for the gas bill, split between ada.\nWhen someone adds what they paid, it is split between them and whoever says they were in on it. Everyone in your group — ada, bo — sees it.\n\nAdd what you paid\n\nWhat it was for:  How much:  Add it, paid by you\n\n"
  ],
  "logs": [
    "error: Failed to load resource: the server responded with a status of 404 (Not Found)"
  ],
  "said": "Money\n\nYou’re square with everyone.\n\nWho pays whom\n\nNobody owes anybody.\n\nWhat people paid for\n\nYou paid $42.00 for the gas bill, split between ada.\nWhen someone adds what they paid, it is split between them and whoever says they were in on it. Everyone in your group — ada, bo — sees it.\n\nAdd what you paid\n\nWhat it was for:  How much:  Add it, paid by you\n\n",
  "title": "Money"
}
